  title: I am ??
  body: "I woke up in the shelter with no memory of who I was or how I got there. My terminal still functions, but my identity login has been completely erased, leaving me unable to access any personal records or information. Everything I once knew about myself seems to have disappeared along with my identity."
  clueId: clue_i_am_unknown